{{Nihongo|'''Sanese Baliscans'''|三國人バリスカ人|Sangokujin Barisuka-jin|lead=yes|{{langx|bl|Sanés-baliscanos}}}} are [[Baliscans|Baliscan citizens]] who are nationals or naturals of [[Sanese people|Sanese]] ancestry, Sanese immigrants living in [[Balisca]] or Sanese people of Baliscan ancestry. In 2024, [[Instituto Confederal de Stadística]] (ICS) stated that there were 2.6 million Sanese descendants in Balisca, making it the country with the largest population of Sanese origin outside of [[East Fosia]]. 

